   "titulo": "Conformity",
   "texto": [
    "**-o** adjectives have four forms: alt**o**, alt**a**, alt**i**, alt**e**. The adjectives in **-e** have only two: giovan**e** (singular) and giovan**i** (plural).",
    "Look at the plurals: the masculine in -or does the plural in **-i** and the feminine in -a, in **-e**. There's no plural in -s.",
